# Places Worth Going seed -- moved out of the repo 2026-09-08 (~100MB,
# uncompressible-by-git binary-ish data that was doubling the repo's
# history size on every rebuild). It now lives in the ./data bind mount
# above (see app/config.py's places_seed_path / docs/features/places.md),
# but an existing checkout's working copy stays at this path until moved
# -- ignored here so it can't be re-added to git by accident.
/app/reference/places_worth_going.csv
/app/reference/places_worth_going.csv.gz

